7
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:24,730
This is the most effective.

8
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:50,200
Chu Feng.

9
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:53,200
My student is actually so talented.

10
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:55,039
Master, Master,

11
00:01:55,039 --> 00:01:56,560
