12
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:58,960
It might be a temporary misunderstanding.

13
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:00,200
Master.

14
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:02,280
Go and have a good talk with them.

15
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:09,340
You love to snitch, don't you?

16
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:13,490
Senior brother.

17
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:19,420
Let me tell you,

18
00:02:19,640 --> 00:02:21,400
