24
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:34,760
Sir.

25
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,680
It's not us going too far.

26
00:02:36,680 --> 00:02:38,240
It's Chu Feng.

27
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:40,360
